{"id":4644,"date":"2023-03-18T09:53:58","date_gmt":"2023-03-18T09:53:58","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/archeryengland.org\/?page_id=4644"},"modified":"2025-06-04T09:18:00","modified_gmt":"2025-06-04T09:18:00","slug":"team-selection-process","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/archeryengland.org\/team-selection-process\/","title":{"rendered":"Team Selection Process"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Welcome to our new selection process.&nbsp; This has been designed to streamline score submission and make it quicker and easier for you, the archer.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We are introducing electronic score submission forms to use for each of the Archery England teams and events.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We are also introducing a new England Rankings system.&nbsp; This will not be used for selection, but as a tool to see how you measure up against your peers and for a bit of fun!&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>HOW THE SYSTEM WORKS<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>To start you need to register your interest using the Registration form&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>If you want to take part in Rankings, please use the Rankings forms&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>There are separate forms for the various events (including the Youth Festival, CACE, and Home Nations)&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>You can opt to take part in team events and selection, or rankings, or both&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>UPDATE<\/strong> &#8211; Deadline for Score Submissions for National Indoor Teams extended to be announced<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Once you have submitted scores, we will produce a Rankings List and select our teams&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=